From 977acc763e14488f95be51e9561f6cb9d15c4189 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 08:57:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vk_exec_draw: NX2NAVI_POOL_IDLE_MS=<ms> (0: off) looks newly
 registered texture slots up at the start of a present's first submission
 while no draw binds the pools, so an area's textures are made a few a frame
 during the load screen instead of all at its first draw (4,869 entering
 Market: the area load mode, its presents left out for 1.4-1.9 s)

---
